---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`NFL Uniform Mixer | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="An interactive static web application for visualizing and customizing matchups between NFL teams." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="project-header">
				<h1>NFL Uniform Mixer</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">An interactive web application to visualize and customize NFL team uniform matchups.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="iframe-container glass-card">
				<iframe 
					src="https://LukeBDaniel.github.io/NFL-Uniforms/" 
					title="NFL Uniforms Application"
					frameborder="0"
					allowfullscreen
				></iframe>
			</div>

			<div class="prose glass-card mt-4">
				<h3>About this Project</h3>
				<p>I built NFL Uniform Mixer because I wanted a tool to play around with uniform combinations and see how they look in a matchup. Users can choose home and away teams, mix helmets, jerseys, pants, and socks, and export an image of the result.</p>
				<p>The preview places both teams side by side so users can compare uniform combinations. The "Save Image" feature crops and scales the composition into a 1920×1080 PNG for sharing.</p>
				<p>Built with vanilla JavaScript, HTML, and CSS, the application handles uniform selection, preview updates, and image export in the browser. It is deployed as a static site.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 1.5em; display: flex; gap: 1em; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="https://LukeBDaniel.github.io/NFL-Uniforms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn glass-card">Open Full Page</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/LukeBDaniel/NFL-Uniforms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn glass-card">View on GitHub</a>
                </div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.project-header {
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}
	.iframe-container {
		width: 100%;
		height: 85vh;
		min-height: 700px;
		padding: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}
	iframe {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: none;
		background: transparent;
	}
	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25em;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
	.mt-4 {
		margin-top: 1.5em;
	}
    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.5em 1em;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--accent);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 4px;
        transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover {
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
    }
</style>
